<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ARENZE — Small tools. Big possibilities.</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#f7f7f7; --card:#fff; --text:#111;
  --muted:#777; --line:#e5e5e5; --accent:#111;
}
body.dark {
  --bg:#101010; --card:#1b1b1b; --text:#f5f5f5;
  --muted:#aaa; --line:#333; --accent:#f5f5f5;
}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
body {
  margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  transition:.2s;
}
header {
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  padding:18px 6%;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.logo {font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}
button,input,textarea {font:inherit}
button {cursor:pointer}
.theme {
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);
  color:var(--text);border-radius:20px;padding:8px 12px;
}
main {max-width:850px;margin:auto;padding:55px 20px}
.badge {color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px}
h1 {font-size:clamp(38px,9vw,65px);line-height:1.05;margin:18px 0}
h1 span {color:var(--muted)}
.subtitle {color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
.tools {
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;margin:35px 0;
}
.tool {
  text-align:left;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:15px;background:var(--card);color:var(--text);
}
.tool:focus,.tool:hover {border-color:var(--text)}
.tool b {display:block;margin-bottom:7px}
.tool small {color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.panel {
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:18px;padding:20px;
}
.panel h2 {margin-top:0}
textarea {
  width:100%;min-height:110px;resize:vertical;
  background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
  padding:14px;outline:none;
}
.primary {
  background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);border:0;
  border-radius:12px;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:700;
  margin-top:12px;width:100%;
}
.result {
  display:none;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.7;
  margin-top:18px;padding:15px;border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);
}
.actions {display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
.actions button {
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
  padding:9px;background:var(--card);color:var(--text);
}
footer {text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:30px 15px;font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:450px) {
  .tools {grid-template-columns:1fr}
  main {padding-top:35px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">ARENZE.</div>
  <button class="theme" id="theme">☾ Theme</button>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="badge">YOUR PERSONAL THINKING SPACE</div>
  <h1>Think bigger.<br><span>Start here.</span></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Small tools. Big possibilities.<br>
  Turn your thoughts into your next move.</p>

  <div class="tools">
    <button class="tool" data-mode="chat">
      <b>✳ AI Assistant</b>
      <small>Ask questions and explore ideas.</small>
    </button>
    <button class="tool"
